  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of America’s largest retailers of automotive running boards and vehicle accessories. We take pride in our strict quality control that ensures only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories reach our customers. Every step of our production process involves a high degree of precision to ensure our running boards feature the perfect finish for enhanced slip resistance.\nFitment\n2005-2023 Toyota Tacoma Access Cab\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2005-2023 Toyota Tacoma Access Cab (If you’re not sure what model you have, please check the cab size picture).\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - A 6.5\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb.\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6.5-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity).\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent performance and looks for years to come.\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour.",
